# Determinism of `xpacd` (pac::strip, whose block is `pure`;
# verus/seams/sys-pac-strip.md): copy `a` runs the canonical `xpacd x0`,
# copy `b` the site's `xpacd @D@`, from independent states in the same
# configuration (pac-footprint.job.in). The same pointer gives the same
# result. run.sh prepends the copy and insn lines.
writes R0 @D@
no-mem-write
mem-reads 0
flags-preserved
assume (= a.init.R0 b.init.@D@)
assert (= a.final.R0 b.final.@D@)
